          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>When Vigil fell to Tar-Baphon's Radiant Fire, that lost innocence brought you a deeper understanding of what faith means in the context of your own magic. When you cast a halcyon spell, you can choose for it to be a divine spell instead of arcane or primal. You gain a halcyon cantrip and a 1st-rank halcyon spell.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 14
          },
          "prerequisites": {
