          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You invoke religious portents to ward yourself against danger without losing sight of the history that led to this point. When you use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Dualistic Synergy], if your next action is to Cast a Spell from your spell slots and that spell is divine, you gain a +1 status bonus to AC for 1 round. If the spell is a halcyon spell, you gain this benefit in addition to the benefits described in Dualistic Synergy.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Tripartite Omen]</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 18
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "Dualistic Synergy"
              },
              {
                "value": "Shattered Sacrament"
              },
              {
                "value": "master in Religion"
              }
            ]
          },
